# 系统管理

### 获取角色列表 -有分页
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getRoleList?current=0&size=20
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "current": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### 获取用户列表 -有分页
#GET {{url}}/systemManage/getUserList?userName=&userGender=&nickName=&userPhone=&userEmail=&userStatus=&current=0&size=20
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getUserList?current=0&size=20&userGender=1
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "current": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### 获取所有角色
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getAllRoles
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取菜单列表 -有分页
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getMenuList/v2?current=0&size=20
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取所有页面组件
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getAllPages
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取菜单树
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getMenuTree
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### 获取所有API
GET {{url}}/systemManage/getAllApi
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}